<title>UK: TABLE-JKX Oil &amp; Gas H1 profits 4.65 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-JKX Oil &amp; Gas H1 profits 4.65 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		    1.29		vs    1.77 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax			  4.65		vs    0.92 loss</p>
<p> Turnover			 18.3		vs    4.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Britain's JKX Oil &amp; Gas has agreed to a 54 million stg takeover by Ramco Energy Plc.</p>
<p>Full company name - JKX Oil &amp; Gas Plc.</p>
